        "content": "<p><a href=\"https://github.com/alexcrichton\">alexcrichton</a> added the wasmtime:pooling-allocator label to <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/13982\">Issue #13982</a>.</p>",
